# The build context is the repo root. Only docker/, scripts/ and patches/ are
# ever read from it. The rest is documentation, host-side tooling, investigation
# output (the ORT backend-test logs run to tens of megabytes), the vLLM fork, and
# the archived rocm7.14/ and rocm6.4.4/ lines.
#
# This does not affect layer caching. BuildKit keys a COPY or a bind mount on the
# checksums of the files it actually reads, not on the whole context.
*.md
*.log
tools/
vllm/
rocm7.14/
rocm6.4.4/
llama-cpp-gfx803/
